/* Wenshu English (en) — baseline / source of truth
 *
 * Per AGENTS.md v0.09.0 + v0.38 ticket P2 (= Apple-standard i18n,
 * en + zh-Hans, default = user's OS language per Apple canonical
 * Locale.current). Every key here must also exist in zh-Hans.lproj.
 *
 * Format: "key" = "value";
 * Special chars escape: " for quote, \n for newline, \\ for backslash.
 * Do NOT use format string positional indexes ({0}, {1}) — use
 * named-style placeholders ({name}) to keep translator order-flexible.
 *
 * When adding a new key, add it to BOTH en.lproj and zh-Hans.lproj
 * in the same commit. tests/WenshuAppTests/I18nParityTests.swift
 * asserts catalog parity at build time.
 */

